WEBVTT

00:03:30.121 --> 00:03:34.538
And that's very unfortunate because
actually increasing happiness

00:03:34.538 --> 00:03:37.288
and reducing misery are
very different things.

00:03:37.538 --> 00:03:40.829
I agree. And it's interesting to hear
you say that reducing misery is more

00:03:40.829 --> 00:03:43.163
important than promoting happiness.

00:03:43.163 --> 00:03:46.579
In some ways, that feels like a critique
of the positive psychology movement.

00:03:47.121 --> 00:03:48.121
It is.

00:03:48.329 --> 00:03:49.704
And tell me a little bit more about why.

00:03:50.246 --> 00:03:57.871
Well, I think the positive psychology
movement has in some ways

00:03:57.871 --> 00:04:00.663
a deeply conservative position.